  "description": "The scheduled service on route **r-01-xyz**, following stop\u2011pattern **rsp-123**, runs between the origin stop **s-01-abc** and the destination stop **s-02-def**. Trains arrive at the origin at\u202f08:00:00 and depart at\u202f08:05:00, then arrive at the destination at\u202f09:30:00 and leave at\u202f09:35:00. All times are in the **America/New_York** time zone, and the service operates within the daily window from\u202f08:00:00 to\u202f10:00:00. Service is available from **2023\u201101\u201101** through **2023\u201112\u201131**, on weekdays (Monday\u202fthrough\u202fFriday) only; Saturday and Sunday are off. An extra run is added on **2023\u201107\u201104**, and there are no explicit exception dates.  \n\nThe trip carries the identifier **T12345**, is labelled \u201cDowntown\u201d (headsign) and short\u2011named **D1**. Bikes are permitted on board, the vehicle belongs to block **B123**, and both pickup and drop\u2011off types are coded\u202f0. The route segment covers **12.5** units of shape distance, is wheelchair\u2011accessible, and includes a metadata tag\u202f{\u201ckey\u201d:\u202f\u201cvalue\u201d}. No additional service\u2011except dates are defined."
